title: "varclock: the market's variance calendar from S&P 500 option chains"
abstract: "Model-free daily variance calendar and event variance read from one S&P 500 option-chain snapshot: a tested rebuild of the Cboe volatility-index methodology, a forward-variance strip over daily expirations and a variance clock with event, weekend and base terms."
